    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's the beat, I hear it in his sleep sometimes",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Blare it in ya jeep, so ya peeps could stare at the rhymes",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Real rhymes, not your everyday hologram",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Even when ribs is touching, never swallowed the ham",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He'd rather eat a sand sandwich salad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It might need salt, like ya man's bland ballad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "A lot of stuff happens that the news won't tell you's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Blues on L juice, snooze, all hell loose",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Rake it, take it like \"The Good, The Bad, The Ugly\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Break it, rollin' through ya hood in the Caddy buggy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Butter softy leather, flossin' fatty juggy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Always threw me off when she told me, \"Daddy, funk me!\"",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "...I'm like, \"Anywho's –\"",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Seeds walkin' all out in the street with out any shoes",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I guess it's better than some funky socks",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You need to get her some 'scripts before she catch the Monkeypox",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "She wanna hear the beatbox",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Take pills and make fake krills that's sheetrock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Sing it, bring it back to your laboratory",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "While he's in his oratory glory, it's like a horror story",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "The mask is like Jason",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "He told the place not to let the basket type case in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "He might be some type of wacko",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Looking for a chance to heat the pipes like a crack ho",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "He said, \"Blessed be the Lord",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Who believe any mess they read up on a message board\"",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "If so, I got a bridge for the low low",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Them type fools go snitch to the po-po",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Here, orange peel L's for the whole tier",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Feel like he been gone the whole year, came home to old gear",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "It was the shit when he first scooped it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "At least you get to sit out in New York and curse stupid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "He plead the Fifth, and sip wine stiffly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Patiently come up, and be spiffy in a jiffy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "A gift with the grind, criminal mind shifty cat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Swift with the 9 through a 5950 hat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "You hear it when you meditate in deep theta",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Let her hate the creep plater",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Dedicated cheap skater who keep data",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Stay self-medicated to sleep later",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Side effects is similar to sugar pill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Nobody go next on the mic, he put a booger– ill!",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "He made his exit on some calm shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Begged on the regs for the kegs of the vomit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
